{"questions":[{"question_id":"JnVxfFklhai9cnER","paperTitle":"JEE Advanced 2013 Paper 1 Offline","year":2013,"examDate":2013,"subject":"physics","chapter":"impulse-and-momentum","chapterGroup":"mechanics","topic":"collision","type":"mcq","marks":2,"negMarks":0.5,"permalink":"a-particle-of-mass-m-is-projected-from-the-ground-with-an-in-2013-marks-2-jnvxffklhai9cner.htm","content":"A particle of mass m is projected from the ground with an initial speed u<sub>0</sub> at an angle <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> with the horizontal. At the highest point of its trajectory, it makes a completely inelastic collision with another identical particle, which was thrown vertically upward from the ground with the same initial speed u<sub>0</sub>. The angle that the composite system makes with the horizontal immediately after the collision is ","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.912ex\" height=\"2.361ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -698.8 845.2 1043.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></us